WEBVTT

00:02:59.196 --> 00:03:03.076
I’m about seven times more likely
to be stopped and searched.

00:03:03.076 --> 00:03:06.156
And with a new policing bill
and public order bill,

00:03:06.196 --> 00:03:08.196
these biases are only set to increase.

00:03:08.676 --> 00:03:10.956
Noise restriction on protests.

00:03:10.996 --> 00:03:13.636
Criminalization of protesters

00:03:13.636 --> 00:03:16.596
without having to convict them of a crime.

00:03:16.636 --> 00:03:18.236
Police can stop and search anyone

00:03:18.276 --> 00:03:21.236
saying they have reasonable suspicion

00:03:21.276 --> 00:03:23.996
and threaten peaceful protest tactics.

00:03:24.036 --> 00:03:25.516
The fear is real.

00:03:26.796 --> 00:03:27.956
So, you know.

00:03:28.836 --> 00:03:30.196
Keep your head down.